{
  "_review_pairing_rationale": "Single-host local-model design dogfood for RFC 0136; review independence is provided by the distinct scorekeeper/arbitrator/dissent_reviewer roles + the bounded dissent->arbitrate cycle, not by model-family diversity. Upgrade to multi-model lanes when host-provisioned.",
